  "live_records": {
    "q-25402": {
      "dom_id": "step-q25402",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Find all the values of $x$ that satisfy $2x-5>1$ or $2x-7<13.$",
      "worked_solution": "We start by solving $2x-5>1:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x-5 & >1 \\\\ 2x & >6 \\\\ x & >3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14237546/assets/2048d360b427cfd94e92a16f7b9f8cd9ca9c88e808bf3b6205d60eebd71aa1cf.png)\n\nThen, we solve $2x-7<13:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x-7 & <13 \\\\ 2x & <20 \\\\ x & <10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14237546/assets/c1a63d1c991f309dbc10a89f0416c910c2c31bde5fdf069682a6127a1f66987a.png)\n\nTo graph the values of $x$ that satisfy either inequality, we overlay the two graphs on the same number line:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14237546/assets/e03d04e5d2d5d571f5b80353081253087f99b2bf58fd86ae56eff3af26415b92.png)\n\nTherefore, the final solution is $x<10$ or $x>3.$ We can write this using interval notation as $x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-25402-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "(-10,3)",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"3\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-25402-b",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "(-\\infty ,-3)\\cup (10,\\infty )",
